{
  "slug": "jobpilot",
  "name": "Jobpilot",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automate your job search end-to-end with Claude Code. JobPilot searches job boards, scores matches against your resume, auto-fills application forms via browser automation, generates tailored cover letters and Upwork proposals, and preps you for interviews. The Autopilot skill lets you approve a batch of jobs once, then walk away while Claude applies to all of them - with progress tracking and resumability.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `apply` (Auto-fill job application forms via Playwright), `apply-batch` (Apply to a queued list of job URLs from the JobPilot batch input), `autopilot` (Autonomously search job boards and apply to matching positions in batch), `cover-letter` (Generate a tailored cover letter from a job description using the user's resume), `interview` (Generate interview prep Q&A tailored to a job description and the user's resume), `search` (Search job boards for matching positions using Playwright), `upwork-proposal` (Generate an Upwork proposal from a job description using the user's resume)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `playwright`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jobpilot@claude-community` from `suxrobgm/jobpilot`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
